cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FireCast in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "FireCast — monthly wildfire focus forecasting (Chapada do Araripe / CE-PE-PI)"
abstract: >-
  Glass-box machine-learning system that forecasts monthly active-fire focus
  counts per municipality (INPE target, IBGE geocode) for the Chapada do
  Araripe operational region, with a fail-closed serving API and exact
  (verifiable) explainability.
type: software
